        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>枪炮交响曲！<>：近处有敌人时用<#ff9028ff>砰砰<>，造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% 攻击力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>，每发加<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>15% 攻击速度<>（至多<#ffb900ff>3<>层）；否则换<#ff9028ff>鱼骨头<>，射程更远，对目标及周围敌人造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110% 攻击力<>的伤害。<#ff9028ff>罪恶快感<>：亲手击杀英雄后<#ffb900ff>6秒<>内<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>25% 攻击速度<>，<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>100% 移动速度<>（逐渐回落）。",
