        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Way of the Hunter<>: <#ffb900ff>20%<> critical strike chance; crits deal double damage. Every second attack strikes with the demon blade for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40% AD<> <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>.",
        "skill": "Thrusts forward, dealing <#ff9028ff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to enemies in a line. It is treated as a basic attack and can critically strike. On hit Yone gains a stack of <#ff9028ff>Gathering Storm<>; at <#ffb900ff>2<> stacks the next cast dashes him forward with a gust of wind that <#ef5350ff>knocks up<> enemies in its path for <#ffb900ff>1s<>.",
        "skill2": "Cleaves a cone for <#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and <#f5f5f5ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>15% AD<> <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<> (champions also take <#f5f5f5ff>5% of their max health<>); each champion hit shields Yone for <#e8d44dff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>35% AD<>. Every <#ffb900ff>15s<> it opens with <#ff9028ff>Soul Unbound<>: his spirit dashes at a champion, returns <#ffb900ff>4s<> later and repeats <#ffb900ff>25%<> of its damage to champions as <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>.",
        "ult": "Strikes all enemies in a line for <#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and <#f5f5f5ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>35% AD<> <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<> and <#ef5350ff>knocks them up<> for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<>; Yone appears behind his target."
      },
      "league_ezreal": {
        "name": "Ezreal",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Rising Spell Force<>: each target his abilities hit grants <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>12% attack speed<> for <#ffb900ff>6s<>, stacking up to <#ffb900ff>5<> times; a new hit refreshes it.",
        "skill": "A bolt deals <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>140% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to the first enemy hit (a basic attack: it can crit); on hit, all cooldowns drop to at most <#ffb900ff>2/3<> of their length. <#ff9028ff>Essence Flux<> (every <#ffb900ff>6s<>): first an orb sticks to a nearby enemy champion for <#ffb900ff>4s<>; his next attack or ability on an enemy champion detonates it for <#ff9028ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>.",
        "skill2": "In a fight: with an enemy champion close, Ezreal blinks away from it; with his target out of attack range, he blinks toward it. Then he fires a homing bolt for <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. The bolt also detonates <#ff9028ff>Essence Flux<>.",
        "ult": "After a <#ffb900ff>1s<> charge, fires an energy wave across the map that deals <#ff9028ff>250<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>130% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to enemy champions in its path; minions and monsters take half."
      },
      "league_thresh": {
        "name": "Thresh",
        "attack": "Thresh lashes his chain for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Flay<>: after <#ffb900ff>2s<> without attacking, his next attack deals <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% Ability Power<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Damnation<>: the souls he reaps become his Armor and Ability Power growth.",
        "skill": "Thresh throws his scythe at the first enemy champion in a line (it passes minions), dealing <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>stunning<> it for <#ffb900ff>1s<> and pulling it to him. <#ff9028ff>Dark Passage<>: every <#ffb900ff>14s<> he also throws his lantern, giving himself and a nearby allied champion a <#e8d44dff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40% Ability Power<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<>.",
        "skill2": "Thresh sweeps his chain around him, dealing <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies and <#ef5350ff>slowing<> them by 40% for <#ffb900ff>1s<>. With an enemy champion right on him he <#ef5350ff>knocks them away<>; otherwise, and always right after a hook, he <#ef5350ff>pulls them toward and past him<>.",
        "ult": "Thresh raises a prison of spectral walls where he stands for <#ffb900ff>5s<>. The first enemy champion to touch it takes <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and is <#ef5350ff>slowed<> by 99% for <#ffb900ff>2s<>; later ones take no damage and are slowed for half as long."
