      "league_akali": {
        "name": "Akali",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Assassin's Mark<>: after a spell hits an enemy champion, for <#ffb900ff>4s<> her next attack has <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:range_0><#ff86c2ff>double range<> and deals <#a974ffff>54<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% Ability Power<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; meanwhile she has <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>30% Move Speed<>.",
        "skill": "Akali throws kunai in a cone, dealing <#a974ffff>65<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>76% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> plus <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>; enemies at the tip are <#ef5350ff>slowed by 50%<>.",
