      },
      "league_nami": {
        "name": "Nami",
        "attack": "Basic attacks fire a bolt of water that deals <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Surging Tides<>: allied champions her spells reach gain <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>20% Move Speed<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>.",
        "skill": "<#ff9028ff>Ebb and Flow<>: water hits an enemy for <#a974ffff>65<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, bounces to a nearby allied champion, healing <#6aff55ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>35% Ability Power<>, then to another enemy champion near that ally for <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40% Ability Power<>. <#ff9028ff>Tidecaller's Blessing<>: the healed ally gains 15% attack and Ability Power for <#ffb900ff>4s<>; enemies hit are <#ef5350ff>slowed<> by 25%.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Aqua Prison<>: Nami throws a bubble at an enemy (champions first). Where it lands, enemies take <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and are trapped and <#ef5350ff>knocked up<> for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>.",
        "ult": "<#ff9028ff>Tidal Wave<>: a huge wave rolls toward an enemy champion, dealing <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies in its path, <#ef5350ff>knocking them up<> for <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> and <#ef5350ff>slowing<> them by 60% for <#ffb900ff>2s<> (<#ffb900ff>3s<> once it has rolled far). Allied champions it passes gain double <#ff9028ff>Surging Tides<>."
      },
      "league_diana": {
        "name": "Diana",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#a974ffff>Moonsilver Blade<>: every <#ffb900ff>third<> attack cleaves enemies around its target for <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; after each spell she gains <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>40% Attack Speed<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>.",
        "skill": "<#a974ffff>Crescent Strike<>: Diana hurls a crescent (at a nearby enemy champion first) that deals <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to every enemy on its path and afflicts them with <#a974ffff>Moonlight<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>.",
        "skill2": "<#a974ffff>Lunar Rush<>: dash to the target for <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; with <#a974ffff>Moonlight<> up she dashes again at once (champions first). <#a974ffff>Pale Cascade<> (every <#ffb900ff>10s<>): on arrival a <#e8d44dff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40% AP<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> and three orbs that hit nearby enemies for <#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20% AP<> each; after the third the shield comes again.",
        "ult": "<#a974ffff>Moonfall<>: Diana draws nearby enemy champions to her and <#ef5350ff>slows<> them by <#ffb900ff>40%<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<>. <#ffb900ff>1s<> later the moon crashes on her for <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> around her, <#ffb900ff>+35%<> for each champion pulled beyond the first (up to <#ffb900ff>+70%<>)."
